  {
    "id": "Castor-1",
    "title": "Castor 1",
    "manufacturer": "Thiokol",
    "description": "The Castor 1 was first used for a suborbital launch of a Scout X-1 rocket in 1960. Castor 1 stages were also used as strap-on boosters for vehicles with Thor first stages, including the Delta-D.",
