    "description": "The NASA Evolutionary Xenon Thruster (NEXT) project at NASA GRC produced quite a little marvel. Certified for flight use, and currently planned for several outer-Solar-System missions, the efficiency of the ion thruster greatly increased the payload weight, at the expense of burn time. Uses about 6.9kW of electricity.",
