    "description": "The pulsed inductive thruster uses a powerful magnetic pulse to ionize and accelerate gas. It can achieve impressive ISPs, and be scaled up simply by increasing the pulse rate. However, it consumes a considerable amount of power. The NuPIT (Nuclear-Electric Pulsed Inductive Thruster) is based on the PIT Mk VII, redesigned for extremely long life for Ice Giant and even Interstellar missions.",
