    "description": "A Soviet gas generator hypergolic vacuum engine designed for use on the TKS FGB (Functional Cargo Block). Extremely reliable and with restart capability, it has been used on many FGB derivatives, such as later Almaz stations, Skif, Kvant-1 FSM, Kvant-2, Krystal, Spektr, Priroda, Zarya, and Nauka. The pump of the KRD-442 can also be used to internally transfer fuel or refuel from Progress resupply craft.",
