    "title": "RD-0243",
    "manufacturer": "Design Bureau of Chemical Automation (КБХА)",
    "description": "Staged combustion booster engine module. Developed as the first stage engine of the R-29RM Submarine-Launched Ballistic Missile, the RD-0243 consists of an RD-0244 main engine and RD-0245 vernier engine. In order to save space, the engine is submerged within the fuel tank of the R-29RM, with the rear bulkhead of the missile welded to the engine nozzle. Also used on the Shtil' launch vehicle, a unique smallsat launcher capable of being deployed from Delta IV submarines.",
