  {
    "id": "RD57",
    "title": "RD-57",
    "manufacturer": "NPO Saturn",
    "description": "A 1970s low TWR staged combustion hydrolox upper stage engine intended for use on the N1/N1M. A later version designated RD-57M had an extendable nozzle and was intended for the Vulkan and Energia-M rockets. The engine was marketed by Aerojet in the 1990s under the designation D-57 for use on an SSTO demonstrator.",
