  {
    "id": "Star-24C",
    "title": "STAR 24C",
    "manufacturer": "Thiokol",
    "description": "The STAR 24C is an improved variant of the STAR 24 solid rocket motor, designed for the International Ultraviolet Explorer mission. Features an increased propellant loading and higher chamber pressure compared to the baseline STAR 24 motor.",
