  {
    "id": "Star-27",
    "title": "STAR 27",
    "manufacturer": "Thiokol",
    "description": "An apogee motor developed for the Canadian Communications Research Centre's Communications Technology Satellite. An offloaded version was qualified and flown successfully. With various propellant loadings and explosive transfer assemblies, it was used for the Broadcast Satellite Experiment, the Geostationary Meteorological Satellite, the Navigation Technology Satellite No. 2, the Global Positioning System Satellites, the P78-1 Satellite, and the Geostationary Operational Environmental Satellite.",
